<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112851" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φωρ-ά</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φωρή</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φώρ</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>theft,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				h.Merc.
				136
			</span></i> (prob. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φωνῆς</span>), <i><span class="en">
				385
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Bion
				<u>Fr.</u>
				8.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				273
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερῶν χρημάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					672.16
				</span></i>
			 (Delph., <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνοχοι ὄντες φωρᾷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Sammelb.</u>
					4638.17
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ᾽ αὐτῇ τῇ
				φωρᾷ,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ᾽ αὐτοφώρῳ</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				8.69
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>detection, discovery,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ἀλλοτριολογίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Acad.Ind.</u>
					p.67
				</span></i>
			 M.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλγεῖν ἐπὶ τῇ φ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.L.
					1.96
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεῖζον τῆς φ. τὸ αὐτὸν ἑαυτοῦ
					κατειπεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ach.Tat.
					7.11
				</span></i>
			. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φώρης</span> codd. <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
			</span></i> l.c.; <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> has <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φωρά: κλοπή,</span> but
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φώρην: τὴν ἔρευναν.</span>)</div>
